course: dictionary
lesson: 10550
title: Unattended: left alone
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «You do not touch an unattended bag on a platform; you tell staff, who will check it.» Look at the clues. The bag is on a platform, you tell staff, and staff will check it. So unattended must mean the bag has nobody looking after it.
explain: The prefix un- means not, and attended means watched or looked after. Unattended means left alone, with no one watching or caring for it. Try your meaning in the sentence: «You do not touch a bag left alone on a platform» still makes sense, so you have it.
explain: The word can also mean not dealt with or not cared for, as in «a pile of homework left unattended». Check the context each time: the clues tell you which meaning fits.
fact: Unattended means left alone, with no one looking after or watching it.
fact: «Unattended» can also mean not dealt with or not cared for.
fact: «Unattended» is an adjective: it describes a noun, like «an unattended bag».
fact: Safety signs often say «never leave ... unattended» to keep people and places safe.
fact: The prefix un- means not, so «attended» means watched or looked after.
exercise: «You do not touch an unattended bag on a platform.» What does unattended mean? | Heavy and very large | Shiny and new | *Left alone, with no one watching it | Full of things to carry
exercise: Find and copy the one word from the sentence that tells you what to do with a bag left alone. | *check | platform | staff | bag
exercise: «The gate was left unattended, and the animals escaped.» What does unattended suggest here? | Made of wood | Locked and painted | Watched by a guard | *Left open with no one looking after it
test: Mum says, «Never leave a candle unattended.» What does she mean? | Always light it at night | *Never leave it alone with no one watching | Keep it in a box | Give it to a friend
test: A pile of homework is left unattended on the desk. What does unattended mean here? | Coloured in | Done and tidied away | Crumpled and torn | *Not dealt with or not cared for
exam: You see an unattended bag at a station. What should you do? | Open it to see what is inside | Take a photo and post it online | *Tell staff, who will check it | Leave it, then pick it up later
